<section class="cardneto-hero">
 <div><span class="cardneto-pill">FRIENDS OF THE LEGION / 001</span>
 <h1>300 events.<br>One app he<br><em>kept missing.</em></h1>
 <p class="site-lead">Meet the right people. Make time for a conversation. Keep the connection when the event is over.</p>
 <div class="site-actions"><a class="site-button" href="/go/cardneto-demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a demo ↗</a><a class="site-button secondary" href="/go/cardneto-app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get Cardneto ↗</a></div>
